## 🚀 Quick Start

1. Download the GTA VI Installer guide from the official information page.
2. Extract the downloaded guide archive to a folder on your Windows desktop.
3. Run the executable as Administrator to open the installation reference.

The main interface opens with official platform links, installation instructions, and troubleshooting modules.

## 💻 Requirements

| Component | Requirement |
|---|---|
| OS | Windows 10 / 11, 64-bit |
| RAM | 4 GB minimum |
| Storage | 500 MB for the guide |
| Privileges | Administrator |

**Game installation note:** GTA VI is officially available for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. The game itself requires up to 212 GB of available console storage. This guide is not a Windows PC game installer.

