## 📖 Installation Guide

### 1. Check Your Platform
Confirm that you have a PlayStation 5 or Xbox Series X|S. These are the officially listed launch platforms for GTA VI.

### 2. Purchase the Game
Use the official PlayStation or Xbox storefront, or redeem a valid download code for your platform.

### 3. Check Available Storage
Make sure your console has enough free space. Rockstar lists up to 212 GB depending on the device.

### 4. Start the Download
Open your game library or store, select Grand Theft Auto VI, and choose the download or installation option.

### 5. Wait for Installation
Keep your console connected to the internet while the game downloads and installs. Check the download queue if progress stops.

### 6. Complete Activation
If you use a digital code, redeem it through the relevant platform account. Make sure the code matches your account region where required.

### 7. Launch the Game
Once installation and any required updates are complete, open GTA VI from your console library.

