## ❓ FAQ

**Do I need to run it as Administrator?**

Yes — admin rights are required for the overlay to attach.

**Why does Windows display an antivirus warning?**

Review the file source and scan downloaded files with your preferred security software before opening them.

**Does the guide work on Windows 11?**

The desktop guide is structured for Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit systems.

**Can I install GTA VI directly on a Windows PC?**

Rockstar's currently listed launch platforms are PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. A Windows PC version is not listed on the official platform information page.

**How do I keep the installation guide updated?**

Check the official Rockstar support page for the latest installation requirements and platform instructions.

